$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM N-Boc-(1,2,3,6-tetrahydropyridin-4-yl)boronic acid pinacol ester (517 mg,
1.7 mmol), 4-chloro-5-methyl-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (186 mg, 1.1
mmol), PdCl2(PPh3)2 (77 mg, 0.11 mmol), and Na2CO3 (175 mg, 1.7 mmol)
were combined in 3:1 MeCN:H2O (15 mL) and heated by microwave to 160 °C
for 10 min. The MeCN was removed under vacuum, and the mixture was
extracted with EtOAc. The organic extract was washed with H2O, dried, and
concentrated under vacuum. The residue was purified by flash
chromatography (50-100% EtOAc:hexanes).
N-Boc-5-methyl-4-(1,2,3,6-tetrahydropyridin-4-yl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine
(232 mg, 67% yield).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM microwave irradiation
