$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2,4-Diamino-5-(furan-2-yl)-7-(β
-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (8a). An argon-purged
mixture of 2,4-diamino-5-iodo-7-(β-
D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine 2729 (305 mg, 0.75 mmol),
furan-2-boronic acid (126 mg, 1.125 mmol), Na2CO3 (239 mg, 2.25 mmol),
Pd(OAc)2 (8 mg, 0.036 mmol), and TPPTS (53 mg, 0.093 mmol) in water/MeCN
(2:1, 5 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 3 h. After cooling, the mixture was
neutralized using aq HCl (1 M) and concentrated to dryness in vacuo, and
the residue was purified by reverse phase HPFC (C-18, 0→ 100% MeOH in
water) to afford 8a which was crystallized from water.
2,4-Diamino-5-(furan-3-yl)-7-(β
-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (8b). Compound 8b was
prepared as described for 8a from 276 (305 mg, 0.75 mmol) and
furan-3-boronic acid as a white solid (175 mg, 67%), which was
crystallized from water. Mp 247-249 °C. [α ]D -58.2 (c 0.273, DMSO). 1H
NMR (500 MHz, DMSO-d6): 3.50 (ddd, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5´ a,OH = 6.1 Hz,
J5´ a,4´ = 4.1 Hz, H-5´a); 3.59 (ddd, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5´ b,OH = 5.1
Hz, J5´ b,4´ = 4.1 Hz, H-5´b); 3.83 (btd, 1H, J4´ ,5´a = J4´ ,5´b = 4.1
Hz, J4´ ,3´ = 3.2 Hz, H-4´); 4.05 (btd, 1H, J3´ ,2´ = J3´,OH = 4.8 Hz,
J3´ ,4´ = 3.2 Hz, H-3'); 4.34 (td, 1H, J2´ ,1´ = J2´,OH = 6.4, J2´ ,3´ =
5.2 Hz, H-2'); 5.05 (d, 1H, JOH,3´ = 4.5 Hz, OH-3´); 5.17 (bt, 1H,
JOH,5´a = JOH,5´b = 5.7 Hz, OH-5´); 5.24 (d, 1H, JOH,2´ = 6.4 Hz, OH-2´);
5.74 (s, 2H, NH2-2); 5.85 (bs, 2H, NH2-4); 5.94 (d, 1H, J1´,2´ = 6.5 Hz,
H-1'); 6.65 (t, 1H, J4,5 = J4,2 = 1.4 Hz, H-4-furyl); 7.05 (s, 1H, H-6);
7.76 - 7.78 (m, 2H, H-2,5-furyl). 13C NMR (125.7 MHz, DMSO-d6): 62.00
(CH2-5´); 70.83 (CH-3'); 73.43 (CH-2'); 84.82 (CH-4´); 86.33 (CH-1´);
94.86 (C-4a); 106.72 (C-5); 111.55 (CH-4-furyl); 117.12 (CH-6); 119.53
(C-3-furyl); 139.23 (CH-2-furyl); 144.12 (CH-5-furyl); 153.97 (C-7a);
158.10 (C-4); 159.97 (C-2). IR (ATR): ν 1606, 1583, 1489, 1445, 1421,
1334, 1121, 870, 794 cm-1. MS (ESI) m/z 348 (M+H), 370 (M+Na). HRMS (ESI)
for C15H18N5O5 [M+H] calcd: 348.13025; found: 348.13012. Anal.
(C15H17N5O5): C, H, N.
