$DATUM 1-(3-Chloro-5-(1H-pyrazol-4-yl)pyridin-4-yl)piperidine-4-carboxamide
(28)1 To a solution of
1-(3,5-dichloropyridin-4-yl)piperidine-4-carboxamide 9 (24 mg, 0.088
mmol), 4-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-1H-pyrazole (12
mg, 0.11 mmol) and tetrakis(triphenylphosphine)-palladium(0) (5 mg, 5
mol%) in MeCN (1 mL) was added a 0.5 M aqueous sodium carbonate solution
(0.25 mL, 0.12 mmol). The mixture was heated in a microwave reactor at
150 °C for 30 min and concentrated. The crude product was purified by
preparative TLC on silica gel (CH2Cl2, MeOH, 10:1). The title compound 28
as a white solid (18 mg, 67% yield). 1H NMR (500 MHz, CD3OD) δ 1.71-1.85
(m, 4H), 2.28-2.36 (m, 1H), 2.94 (br t, 2H, J = 12.0 Hz), 3.19 (br d, J =
12.0 Hz, 2H), 7.82 (br s, 2H), 8.23 (s, 1H), 8.32 (s, 1H); 13C NMR (126
MHz, CD3OD) δ 30.2, 43.4, 51.6, 117.7, 128.3, 130.1, 149.5, 151.1, 155.1,
180.7 (pyrazole C3 and C5 not observed); LC (Method A) - MS (ESI, m/z) Rt
= 0.57 min – 306/308 (M+H)+. ESI-HRMS: Found: 306.1119 calculated for
C14H17 35ClN5O (M+H)+: 306.1116.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
